# Local scene exports can be hundreds of MB or multiple GB.
# Keep the repo limited to viewer code plus explicitly curated demo payloads.
webxr_viewer/scenes/*
!webxr_viewer/scenes/boy_on_sports_field/
!webxr_viewer/scenes/boy_on_sports_field/**
